          "en": "PROBLEM",
          "title": "射孔孔道形态预测业务问题",
          "html": "<p>靶试成本高、样本少；数值模拟单次计算耗时长，无法在设计阶段快速比较方案。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 335\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"孔道预测尺寸示意\"><title>孔道预测尺寸示意</title><rect width=\"720\" height=\"335\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f6f9f8\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#334741\"><path d=\"M124 265H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"end\">-6.33</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><path d=\"M124 211.25H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"216.25\" text-anchor=\"end\">-3.17</text><text x=\"259.25\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0.22</text><path d=\"M124 157.5H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"162.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><text x=\"394.5\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0.44</text><path d=\"M124 103.75H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"108.75\" text-anchor=\"end\">3.17</text><text x=\"529.75\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0.65</text><path d=\"M124 50H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"end\">6.33</text><text x=\"665\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0.87</text><polyline fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#267d70\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" points=\"124,64.82758620689654 137.525,65.99332335133033 151.05,67.17410413215833 164.575,68.37052643837632 178.10000000000002,69.5832288444567 191.625,70.8128945952158 205.15,72.06025610698401 218.675,73.32610006927231 232.20000000000002,74.61127324785264 245.72500000000002,75.91668911084724 259.25,77.24333542514901 272.775,78.59228300271172 286.3,79.96469581688527 299.82500000000005,81.36184276059652 313.35,82.78511138430224 326.875,84.23602403704729 340.40000000000003,85.71625694529354 353.925,87.22766291072918 367.45000000000005,88.7722985032083 380.975,90.35245688726877 394.5,91.9707077779708 408.02500000000003,93.62994651509919 421.55,95.33345493588948 435.075,97.08497771040649 448.6,98.88881922963779 462.12500000000006,100.74996824370871 475.65000000000003,102.67426063075789 489.17500000000007,104.66859560424254 502.7,106.74122850706433 516.225,108.90217621625374 529.75,111.16379310344826 543.2750000000001,113.54161442222835 556.8000000000001,116.05563662392632 570.325,118.73234790844265 583.85,121.60812847264677 597.375,124.7353538889854 610.9000000000001,128.1944096148189 624.4250000000001,132.12061425353218 637.95,136.77781831196316 651.475,142.84720480740944 665,157.5\"/><polyline fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b5692b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" points=\"124,250.17241379310346 137.525,249.00667664866967 151.05,247.8258958678417 164.575,246.62947356162368 178.10000000000002,245.4167711555433 191.625,244.1871054047842 205.15,242.939743893016 218.675,241.67389993072769 232.20000000000002,240.3887267521474 245.72500000000002,239.08331088915273 259.25,237.756664574851 272.775,236.40771699728828 286.3,235.03530418311476 299.82500000000005,233.63815723940348 313.35,232.21488861569776 326.875,230.76397596295277 340.40000000000003,229.28374305470643 353.925,227.77233708927082 367.45000000000005,226.22770149679172 380.975,224.64754311273123 394.5,223.0292922220292 408.02500000000003,221.3700534849008 421.55,219.66654506411055 435.075,217.9150222895935 448.6,216.1111807703622 462.12500000000006,214.2500317562913 475.65000000000003,212.32573936924214 489.17500000000007,210.33140439575746 502.7,208.25877149293567 516.225,206.09782378374626 529.75,203.83620689655174 543.2750000000001,201.45838557777165 556.8000000000001,198.94436337607368 570.325,196.2676520915574 583.85,193.39187152735323 597.375,190.2646461110146 610.9000000000001,186.8055903851811 624.4250000000001,182.87938574646782 637.95,178.22218168803684 651.475,172.15279519259056 665,157.5\"/><text class=\"plot-x-label\" x=\"394.5\" y=\"324\" text-anchor=\"middle\">距入口轴向距离 / m</text><text class=\"plot-y-label\" x=\"24\" y=\"157.5\" transform=\"rotate(-90 24 157.5)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">半径 / mm</text></g></svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图 1</b><span>合成与预测穿深散点体现留出误差；能量响应曲线只覆盖训练参数范围，推荐是满足目标的最小候选编码。孔道尺寸示意按预测穿深与入口径构造收尖轮廓，不代表三维CT。图中是初始参数的固定种子教学计算，交互演示可重新计算。</span></div>"
